// Plan stage R0z Z9c-C, review round 1 (H2: a value gives a once parameter to code of a caller that runs it two times; with fix (b) a lost W0502, now NESTED_TASK_RUN and rule E, the rule of main; the probe `z9ccrev1/p/f03c_once_ok.wf`).
